    },
    {
      "id": "GltfGpmLocal#storageType",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5107ca1c6b3cdd8113a0c4803fbf0ee86c3f926ceddda4f259d5fa9429e473f8",
      "text": "指定协方差采用间接还是直接存储。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GltfGpmLocal",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d9e30ee3ecd3dec60b215b150cc4de263ad53f12546809afffd1c67419c997e7",
      "text": "局部存储于瓦片或叶节点的地面—空间间接实现 GPM 元数据。对应 {@link https://nsgreg.nga.mil/csmwg.jsp|NGA_gpm_local} glTF 扩展的根对象。加载包含此扩展的模型后，可通过以下调用获取：\n```\rconst gltfGpmLocal = model.getExtension(\"NGA_gpm_local\");\r```\n存储类型决定可选属性是否存在：\n<ul>\n <li>\n 存储类型为 `StorageType.Indirect` 时，存在 `anchorPointsIndirect` 和 `intraTileCorrelationGroups`。\n </li>\n <li>\n 存储类型为 `StorageType.Direct` 时，存在 `anchorPointsDirect` 和 `covarianceDirect`。\n </li>\n</ul>"
    },
    {
      "id": "Spdcf.ConstructorOptions",
