    },
    {
      "id": "Spdcf.ConstructorOptions",
      "field": "properties/alpha/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:89122bcad9989370d719933ca0cfcab6176acff7df1adeb1e2673a84ccd65fa4",
      "text": "alpha 值，范围为 [0, 1)。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Spdcf.ConstructorOptions",
      "field": "properties/beta/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a710d37787226ac4d4da41021906b782c60c65d30a041d742a577450a0a16d7a",
      "text": "beta 值，范围为 [0, 10]。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Spdcf.ConstructorOptions",
      "field": "properties/T/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ea820d9c3fea254f624201791413e8cbe9783e38f6b91603a7b339e57af843d6",
      "text": "tau 值，范围为 (0, +inf)。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Spdcf#A",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5df9456a894f72622348a0ed2478982f20046ff91e43ebb558a0b7f1992cfda1",
      "text": "取值范围为 (0, 1]。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Spdcf#alpha",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:48e28055b31863497e2fe81dd19c71fdcfcdd49da6ab18aab88dc949e9d56b90",
      "text": "取值范围为 [0, 1)。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Spdcf#beta",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5700854b279e6a3084ca0ba85565442aa449982ad85acd93ece5616192f48092",
      "text": "取值范围为 [0, 10]。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Spdcf#T",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:45f0f56907121809b191b1f8a7715bc35a0e8f197f986fe0465cff3c8e8af3af",
      "text": "取值范围为 (0, +inf)。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Spdcf",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b4047d03352f7a813bdaf3d762a8c16956027c175d1e2af44cce43f9caf882c2",
      "text": "严格正定相关函数的变量。对应 {@link https://nsgreg.nga.mil/csmwg.jsp|NGA_gpm_local} glTF 扩展中的 `spdcf` 定义。此类型实例作为参数存储在 `CorrelationGroup` 中。参数 (A, alpha, beta, T) 描述相关性随时间差的衰减：\n```\rspdcf(delta_t) = A_t * (alpha_t + ((1 - alpha_t)(1 + beta_t)) / (beta_t + e^(delta_t/T_t)))\r```"
    },
    {
      "id": "StorageType.Direct",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:8ccb8c57e7767b3b9503bbbf8d9c56b6824886adfaa497f7539368dca04c90cc",
      "text": "存储锚点的完整误差协方差，包括交叉协方差项。"
    },
    {
      "id": "StorageType.Indirect",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f8c90c7104e3bd19f3641912e7a655dbea0d5b11f895ed8d485437ac641904a6",
      "text": "为每个锚点存储完整协方差矩阵，但不直接存储交叉协方差项；这些项可根据元数据中保存的一组空间相关函数参数计算。"
    },
